     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Yes, in a similar way to how ACLs and Timemaps are referenced:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "content": [
           {
            "content": [
             {
              "text": "Link: <",
              "type": "text"
             },
             {
              "marks": [
               {
                "attrs": {
                 "href": "http://demo.fcrepo.org/fcrepo/rest/new/fcr:versions"
                },
                "type": "link"
               }
              ],
              "text": "http://demo.fcrepo.org/fcrepo/rest/new/fcr:versions",
              "type": "text"
             },
             {
              "text": ">; rel=\"timemap\"",
              "type": "text"
             }
            ],
            "type": "paragraph"
           }
          ],
          "type": "listItem"
         },
         {
          "content": [
           {
            "content": [
             {
              "text": "Link: <",
              "type": "text"
             },
             {
              "marks": [
               {
                "attrs": {
                 "href": "http://demo.fcrepo.org/fcrepo/rest/new/fcr:acl"
                },
                "type": "link"
               }
              ],
              "text": "http://demo.fcrepo.org/fcrepo/rest/new/fcr:acl",
              "type": "text"
             },
             {
              "text": ">; rel=\"acl\"",
              "type": "text"
             }
            ],
            "type": "paragraph"
           }
          ],
          "type": "listItem"
         }
        ],
        "type": "bulletList"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "..referencing a resource's containing AG makes sense.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "In the spirit of reducing the scope of Beta ticket to the bare essentials, I suggest we drop this below the line.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
