  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Currently the only way to know if a given resource is a part of an AG is by looking for a",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "language": "java"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Link: <http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#ArchivalGroup>;rel=\"type\"",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "header at each node in the containment hierarchy.  It would be convenient for clients to know whether a given resource is nested within an ArchivalGroup.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": " ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "One approach would be to add a link header for AG nested resources that points to the archival group. So a GET to /my-archival-group/resourcA  for return the following header",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "language": "java"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Link: <http://localhost:8080/rest/my-archival-group>;rel=\"archival-group\"",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": " ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
