     "body": "<p>Yes, in a similar way to how ACLs and Timemaps are referenced:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>Link: &lt;<a href=\"http://demo.fcrepo.org/fcrepo/rest/new/fcr:versions\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://demo.fcrepo.org/fcrepo/rest/new/fcr:versions</a>&gt;; rel=\"timemap\"</li>\n\t<li>Link: &lt;<a href=\"http://demo.fcrepo.org/fcrepo/rest/new/fcr:acl\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://demo.fcrepo.org/fcrepo/rest/new/fcr:acl</a>&gt;; rel=\"acl\"</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>..referencing a resource's containing AG makes sense.</p>\n\n<p>In the spirit of reducing the scope of Beta ticket to the bare essentials, I suggest we drop this below the line.</p>",
